---
// Quiz figure for the color post, Uxq05: three status badges on a page, 1 white on amber, 2 white on dark amber, 3 dark on pale amber.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq05amberbadges">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 190" role="img" aria-label="Three Pending badges on a card. Badge 1: white text on bright amber #F59E0B. Badge 2: white text on dark amber #B45309, a heavy brown block. Badge 3: dark brown #78350F text on pale amber #FEF3C7.">
<rect x="10" y="10" width="580" height="170" rx="12" class="card" />
<text x="100" y="42" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Badge 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhãn 1</tspan></text>
<rect x="25" y="56" width="150" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F59E0B" />
<text x="100" y="86" class="w" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Pending</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đang chờ</tspan></text>
<text x="100" y="128" class="m" text-anchor="middle">#F59E0B / #FFFFFF</text>
<text x="300" y="42" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Badge 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhãn 2</tspan></text>
<rect x="225" y="56" width="150" height="48" rx="8" fill="#B45309" />
<text x="300" y="86" class="w" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Pending</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đang chờ</tspan></text>
